---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import CTASection from '../../components/CTASection.astro';
import BrowserFrame from '../../components/BrowserFrame.astro';

const useCaseJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "Moderation Platform for Social Apps & Communities: Unified Dashboard (2026)",
  "description": "The moderation platform for social apps, forums and communities: unified moderation dashboard, no-code auto-rules, human review and DSA-compliant audit trails. Free to start."
};
---

<BaseLayout title="Moderation Platform for Social Apps & Communities (2026), No Code" description="Run all moderation from one unified dashboard: auto-hide toxic comments, no-code rules, team review queue and DSA audit trails. Free to start." canonical="https://www.openmoderation.com/use-cases/social-platforms" jsonLd={useCaseJsonLd}>
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: "Home", href: "/" }, { label: "Use Cases", href: "/use-cases" }, { label: "Social Platforms" }]} />
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-50 to-white py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-surface-200 bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-sm text-surface-600">
        Use Case
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-surface-900 sm:text-5xl">AI Content Moderation for Social Platforms</h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-surface-500">
        Protect your community as it grows. OpenModeration moderates comments, posts and messages automatically, and your Trust & Safety team gets its own review dashboard.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-16 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-surface-200 bg-surface-50 p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-surface-900">The Challenge</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-surface-600">User posts never stop arriving on a social platform. Manual moderation can't keep up, and rigid keyword filters produce so many false positives that they annoy your community.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-brand-200 bg-brand-50 p-6 shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-brand-700">The OpenModeration Solution</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-surface-700">The AI reads each post in context and in real time, and the Action Engine hides high-risk posts automatically. Borderline cases go straight to your human moderators.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-surface-200 bg-surface-50 p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-surface-900">The Result</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-surface-600">Far fewer posts need a manual review. Full, exportable audit trails keep you DSA-compliant, and your community becomes a safer place to take part.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-surface-900 sm:text-4xl">Moderate every interaction point</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-surface-500">
            Communities that don't act risk regulatory fines and losing members. OpenModeration gives you the tools to stay compliant and safe.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-8 space-y-3">
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-surface-200 bg-surface-50 p-4">
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-surface-900">Real-time comment moderation</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-surface-500">Analyze content before it appears. Route to the best AI provider for your community's specific language.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-surface-200 bg-surface-50 p-4">
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-surface-900">Back-moderation of existing content</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-surface-500">Submit up to 10,000 items in a single batch and clean up months of old content in minutes.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-surface-200 bg-surface-50 p-4">
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-surface-900">Automated enforcement & human review</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-surface-500">Hate speech is hidden automatically and borderline cases are flagged for your team. Every action is logged for compliance.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <BrowserFrame
          src="/images/dashboard.png"
          video="om-triage"
          alt="open-moderation dashboard: the moderation queue with flagged comments, their status and the action taken"
          caption="Your team's workspace: flagged content, decisions and history in one review queue."
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-surface-50 py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-surface-900 sm:text-4xl">Why social platforms choose OpenModeration</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-surface-200 bg-white p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900">Multi-language support</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-surface-500">Route English to OpenAI, French to Mistral, German to Azure. Each content item gets the best provider for its language.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-surface-200 bg-white p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900">Real-time performance</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-surface-500">Typical latency stays under 300ms, which is fast enough to moderate comments inline without slowing users down.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-surface-200 bg-white p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-surface-900">DSA-ready audit trail</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-surface-500">Every moderation decision is logged in full and can be exported for transparency reports and regulatory audits.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-surface-50 py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="mb-8 text-2xl font-bold text-surface-900 sm:text-3xl">Related Resources</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <a href="/blog/dsa-compliance-sme-guide" class="group rounded-xl border border-surface-200 bg-white p-6 transition hover:shadow-md">
          <div class="mb-2 text-xs font-medium text-brand-600">Guide</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-surface-900 group-hover:text-brand-600">DSA Compliance for Small and Medium Platforms</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-surface-500">Practical steps for communities to meet 2026 DSA requirements.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/alternatives/perspective-api" class="group rounded-xl border border-surface-200 bg-white p-6 transition hover:shadow-md">
          <div class="mb-2 text-xs font-medium text-brand-600">Comparison</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-surface-900 group-hover:text-brand-600">OpenModeration vs Perspective API</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-surface-500">Why community forums need a full moderation platform rather than a sunset API.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/features" class="group rounded-xl border border-surface-200 bg-white p-6 transition hover:shadow-md">
          <div class="mb-2 text-xs font-medium text-brand-600">Platform</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-surface-900 group-hover:text-brand-600">Explore All Features</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-surface-500">Discover the Action Engine, team management, and automated workflows.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTASection />
</BaseLayout>